<MainLayout title="Disclaimer" description="Glitched Network disclaimer.">
    <main class="legal-page">
        <article>
            <h1 class="font-PressStart2P">Disclaimer</h1>
            <p>Glitched Network is an independent Minecraft community. It is not an official Minecraft product and is not approved by or associated with Mojang or Microsoft.</p>

            <h2>Minecraft Ownership</h2>
            <p>Minecraft, related names, and related assets belong to their respective owners. Server references to Minecraft are used only to describe compatibility and gameplay.</p>

            <h2>Community Content</h2>
            <p>Player messages, builds, skins, usernames, and other community contributions belong to their creators. Staff may moderate, remove, or restrict content to protect the server and enforce rules.</p>

            <h2>Information Accuracy</h2>
            <p>We try to keep the website accurate, but features, rules, staff lists, rewards, and update details may change. Discord announcements and direct staff guidance may supersede older website content.</p>
        </article>
    </main>
</MainLayout>
